<title>SPAIN: Spain 5-,15-yr yields fall,6-mth bill yield steady.</title>
<headline>Spain 5-,15-yr yields fall,6-mth bill yield steady.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas): ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>6-month    6.581    6.581   96.78    96.78   159.427  141.927</p>
<p>5-year     6.907    7.319  102.10    99.70   481.214  179.037</p>
<p>15-year    7.638    7.900  107.00   103.90    50.865   19.565</p>
</text>
